{'symbol': 'ABT', 'date': '2022-11-29 07:05:00', 'title': 'NOTICE FOR INVESTORS IN ABT: LAWSUIT AGAINST ABBOTT LABORATORIES ANNOUNCED BY SHAREHOLDERS FOUNDATION', 'text': 'SAN DIEGO, CALIFORNIA--(NEWSFILE CORP. - NOVEMBER 29, 2022) - THE SHAREHOLDERS FOUNDATION, INC. ANNOUNCES THAT A LAWSUIT IS PENDING FOR CERTAIN INVESTORS IN SHARES OF ABBOTT LABORATORIES (NYSE: ABT).INVESTORS WHO PURCHASED ABBOTT LABORATORIES (NYSE: ABT) SHARES PRIOR TO FEBRUARY 2021 AND CONTINUE TO HOLD ANY OF THEIR NYSE: ABT SHARES HAVE ALSO CERTAIN OPTIONS AND SHOULD CONTACT THE SHAREHOLDERS FOUNDATION AT MAIL@SHAREHOLDERSFOUNDATION.COM OR CALL +1(858) 779 - 1554.'}